flowchart TD
  A[Incoming request] --> B[Identity and tenant context]
  B --> C[Admission controller]
  C --> D{Queue and context limits}
  D -->|reject| E[Load shed with reason]
  D -->|admit| F[Batch scheduler]
  F --> G[KV cache estimator]
  G --> H{Memory budget}
  H -->|exceeded| E
  H -->|fits| I[Prefill]
  I --> J[Prefix cache and prompt state]
  J --> K[Decode loop]
  K --> L[Optional speculative draft/verify]
  L --> M[Latency cost and quality telemetry]
  M --> N[Response and SLO report]
